        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Community colleges should replicate Viking ROADS-style comprehensive support based on its three-year degree gains.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Viking ROADS increased credential attainment, semester-three enrollment, and credits in a randomized SUNY Westchester evaluation. The evidence comes from one college during COVID-era disruptions, and this report does not provide a complete cost analysis.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
